  "body": "It's easy to write code to redact events from a room. However, when someone decides to leave massive amounts of garbage in a room, that can take a loooong time and be throttled by the server.\r\n\r\nIn this context, it would be useful to have an admin API that could:\r\n1. receive a (possibly very long) list of events to redact;\r\n2. attempt to redact them all;\r\n3. return a list of of events that could not be redacted, if any.",
